{"id":"n67661-1-11","stage":1,"title":"엽서 · 明信片","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n67661-1-11-1","ko":"네 앞으로 엽서가 한 통 왔더구나.","zh":"有一张寄给你的明信片。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네","meaning":"“너의(你的)”的缩略语。","explanation":"네：“너의(你的)”的缩略语。","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84427","senseId":"1","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"앞으로","meaning":"表示“收，致”之意。","explanation":"앞：表示“收，致”之意。；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"앞","audio":"/audio/ec1a6b96ce688b70368d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"88648","senseId":"8","lemma":"앞","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"엽서가","meaning":"明信片","explanation":"엽서：明信片；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"엽서","audio":"/audio/bf0c5b5fad5529c12ac4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67661","senseId":"1","lemma":"엽서","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"한","meaning":"一","explanation":"한：一","readings":[{"term":"한","audio":"/audio/89233692031a62c60e6e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73278","senseId":"1","lemma":"한","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"통","meaning":"通，封，份，个，回","explanation":"통：通，封，份，个，回","readings":[{"term":"통","audio":"/audio/837d5d028930fb39e15f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71294","senseId":"1","lemma":"통","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"왔더구나.","meaning":"来自，传给","explanation":"오다：来自，传给；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；더구나：回顾亲历的情况并表示感叹，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"21","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1c0ddfd005093840","term":"네","zh":"“너의(你的)”的缩略语。","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3","entryId":"84427","definition":"“너의(你的)”的缩略语。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"ec1a6b96ce688b70","term":"앞","zh":"表示“收，致”之意。","audio":"/audio/ec1a6b96ce688b70368d.mp3","entryId":"88648","definition":"表示“收，致”之意。","pronunciation":["압"]},{"id":"bf0c5b5fad5529c1","term":"엽서","zh":"明信片","audio":"/audio/bf0c5b5fad5529c12ac4.mp3","entryId":"67661","definition":"寄信人和收信人的住址，信件的内容在一张上邮寄的用纸。","pronunciation":["엽써"]},{"id":"89233692031a62c6","term":"한","zh":"一","audio":"/audio/89233692031a62c60e6e.mp3","entryId":"73278","definition":"一个的。","pronunciation":["한"]},{"id":"837d5d028930fb39","term":"통","zh":"通，封，份，个，回","audio":"/audio/837d5d028930fb39e15f.mp3","entryId":"71294","definition":"收发信件、文件或接打电话次数的计算单位。","pronunciation":["통"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"来自，传给","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"从其他地方传来。","pronunciation":["오다"]}],"audio":"/audio/67b08fee114ae23f3e6e.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n67661-1-11-2","ko":"네. 영국에서 공부하는 친구가 보낸 거예요.","zh":"是的，是在英国读书的朋友寄来的。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네.","meaning":"是，是的，哎","explanation":"네：是，是的，哎","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17294","senseId":"1","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"영국에서","meaning":"英国","explanation":"영국：英国；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"영국에서","audio":"/audio/d7b782153866e4e9ef82.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"공부하는","meaning":"学习，读书","explanation":"공부하다：学习，读书；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"공부하다","audio":"/audio/002a60f979d8c3de292f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"23394","senseId":"1","lemma":"공부하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"친구가","meaning":"朋友，好友， 友人，故旧","explanation":"친구：朋友，好友， 友人，故旧；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"친구","audio":"/audio/1202aff936337891e079.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29742","senseId":"1","lemma":"친구","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"보낸","meaning":"送，寄","explanation":"보내다：送，寄；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"보내다","audio":"/audio/8af300ffd85ed5a13777.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66375","senseId":"1","lemma":"보내다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"거예요.","meaning":"那个","explanation":"거：那个；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；예요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66342","senseId":"2","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1c0ddfd005093840","term":"네","zh":"是，是的，哎","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3","entryId":"17294","definition":"用于回应长辈的呼叫。","pronunciation":["네"]},{"id":"002a60f979d8c3de","term":"공부하다","zh":"学习，读书","audio":"/audio/002a60f979d8c3de292f.mp3","entryId":"23394","definition":"通过学习学问或技术而获得知识。","pronunciation":["공부하다"]},{"id":"1202aff936337891","term":"친구","zh":"朋友，好友， 友人，故旧","audio":"/audio/1202aff936337891e079.mp3","entryId":"29742","definition":"关系亲近而交往甚密的人。","pronunciation":["친구"]},{"id":"8af300ffd85ed5a1","term":"보내다","zh":"送，寄","audio":"/audio/8af300ffd85ed5a13777.mp3","entryId":"66375","definition":"把人或东西等弄到别的地方去。","pronunciation":["보내다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"那个","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"66342","definition":"指代前面已经讲过的对象。","pronunciation":["거"]}],"audio":"/audio/4e30a9e92e0c3904b9fe.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.04,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=67661","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":58,"sequenceScore":2.7653,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["是的，是在英国读书的朋友寄来的。","有一张寄给你的明信片。","您父亲身体怎么样？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["有一张寄给你的明信片。","您父亲身体怎么样？","是的，是在英国读书的朋友寄来的。"],"answer":2}]}
